  "description": "Nam Yu-Ho, who entered veterinary school out of a deep love for cats and has now become a third-year student, has a recent worry. Not only did a junior named Ryu Si-An, whom he met while caring for a stray cat named Man-Duk, appear in his dreams in the form of a cat, but he also dreamt of having sex with him while he was a cat. Hit by a reality check over this perverted dream that violates professional ethics, Yu-Ho tries to avoid Si-An as much as possible, but…\n\nWait? Who are you? Why are you showing up in real life dressed as a cat?!\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
